consec rank over 400 random 8-sets (beats = strictly better):
  kappa2(EVEN,A)  : 0/400 random beat consec  (consec MAX)
  kappa3(ODD,B)   : 0/400 random beat consec  (consec MAX)
  kappa4(EVEN)    : 0/400 random beat consec  (consec MIN)
  bimod q0+q6     : 0/400 random beat consec  (consec MAX)

=> A (even k2) & B (odd k3) BOTH consec-maximized => ONE target (the bimodal/phi^4 extremizer);
   consec MIN k4 = the phi^4 stabilizer. The two dualities = the IE parity = Eisenstein(+even)/Legendre(-odd).
